  "slug": "the-k-th-lexicographical-string-of-all-happy-strings-of-length-n",
  "title": "长度为 n 的开心字符串中字典序第 k 小的字符串",
  "status": "published",
  "qualityGate": "tested",
  "batch": "batch-020",
  "studyTags": [
    "字符串",
    "回溯"
  ],
  "summary": "开心字符串只含 a、b、c 且相邻字符不同，返回长度 n 的字典序第 k 个，不足 k 个则返回空串。",
  "insight": "按 a、b、c 顺序回溯生成，完整字符串自然是字典序；计数到 k 时保存并提前终止。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "相邻字符不能相同",
    "k 从一开始计数",
    "候选不足时返回空串"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "lexicographic-backtracking",
      "title": "字典序回溯",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "按字母升序枚举所有合法前缀并在第 k 个停止。",
      "steps": [
        "current 为空、count=0",
        "递归中枚举 a..c，跳过等于末字符的字母",
        "长度为 n 时 count++，等于 k 保存答案并向上传播停止"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(3·2^(n-1))",
        "space": "O(n)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/lexicographic-backtracking/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/lexicographic-backtracking/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/lexicographic-backtracking/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
}
